           05  I1-MATL-GRP           PIC X(9).
           05  I1-SHORT-TEXT         PIC X(40).
           05  I1-PO-QTY             PIC 9(10)V999.
           05  I1-PO-QTY-R  REDEFINES  I1-PO-QTY
                                     PIC X(13).
           05  I1-UM                 PIC X(6).
           05  I1-PRICE              PIC 9(9)V99.
           05  I1-PRICE-R  REDEFINES  I1-PRICE
                                     PIC X(11).
           05  I1-PRICE-UNIT         PIC 9(5).
           05  I1-PRICE-UNIT-R  REDEFINES  I1-PRICE-UNIT
                                     PIC X(5).
           05  I1-PRICE-UM           PIC X(6).
      *----------- LENGTH CHANGED FROM 23 TO 18.  12/18/98
           05  I1-ACCOUNT-NUM.
               10  I1-CO             PIC X(3).
               10  I1-PRIME          PIC X(3).
               10  I1-CLASS          PIC X(3).
               10  I1-DEPT           PIC X(4).
               10  I1-ADDL-DATA      PIC X(5).
      *---------- FIELD ELIMINATED.   1/6/99
      **** 05  I1-COST-CENTER        PIC X(18).
           05  I1-REC-IND            PIC X      VALUE SPACE.
           05  I1-TAX-CODE           PIC X(2).
           05  I1-INV-IND1           PIC X.
           05  I1-INV-IND2           PIC X.
           05  I1-OVERALL-LIMIT      PIC 9(11)V99.
           05  I1-OVERALL-LIMIT-R  REDEFINES  I1-OVERALL-LIMIT
                                     PIC X(13).
           05  I1-EXP-VALUE          PIC 9(11)V99.
           05  I1-EXP-VALUE-R  REDEFINES  I1-EXP-VALUE
                                     PIC X(13).
           05  I1-DLV-QTY            PIC 9(10)V999.
           05  I1-DLV-QTY-R  REDEFINES  I1-DLV-QTY
                                     PIC X(13).
           05  I1-INV-QTY            PIC 9(10)V999.
           05  I1-INV-QTY-R  REDEFINES  I1-INV-QTY
                                     PIC X(13).
           05  I1-DLV-VALUE          PIC 9(11)V99.
           05  I1-INV-VALUE          PIC 9(11)V99.
           05  I1-MAN-ADDR           PIC X(10)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                PIC X(21)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  I1-NEW-WORK           PIC X(06)  VALUE SPACES.

      *-------- NEW I2 RECORD FORMAT INTRODUCED 12/98; HOWEVER, CSIS
      *-------- WILL NOT PROVIDE THIS INFO.  THIS I2 REC IS REALLY THE
      *-------- NEW FORMAT I3, BUT THE REC-ID ONLY WAS CHANGED.  THE
      *-------- REFERENCES TO "I2" WERE ALL RETAINED IN THE PROGRAM.
       01  I2-REC.
           05  I2-PO-NUM             PIC X(10).
           05  I2-REC-ID             PIC X(2)   VALUE "I3".
           05  I2-ITEM-NO            PIC 9(5).
           05  I2-ITEM-NO-R  REDEFINES  I2-ITEM-NO
                                     PIC X(5).
           05  I2-TEXT               PIC X(72).
           05  FILLER                PIC X(177) VALUE SPACES.

      /****************************************************************
      **  P R O C E D U R E   D I V I S I O N                        **
      *****************************************************************

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       START-PGM.
           PERFORM 1-HSK.
           PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-MAIN-X.
           PERFORM 2-EOJ.
           GOBACK.

       1-HSK.

           OPEN INPUT  DPORECD-I
                       DPOITEM-I
                       DPODATAITM-I
                       DINVRCD-I
                       DINVITM-I
                       DCOMMENT-I
                       MPLTINFO-I
                       MSTORERM-I
                       MVALIDPLTDATA-I
                       INSTR-FILE.
           OPEN OUTPUT PRINT-FILE
                       BLANKET-FILE
                       CONTRACT-FILE
                       PURCH-FILE
                       UNCLASS-FILE.

           MOVE 61     TO LINE-CTR.
           MOVE 0      TO BLK-RECS-CTR, TOT-RECS-CTR,
                          CNT-RECS-CTR, PUR-RECS-CTR.
      *--------- GET HOME CURRENCY CODE.
           MOVE "N"    TO DPORECD-EOF-SW.
           MOVE "CCHM" TO PLTINFOKEY  OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE SPACES                  TO  HOLD-HOME-CUR
           ELSE
               MOVE MPLTINFO-HOME-CUR-CODE  TO  HOLD-HOME-CUR.

      *--------- GET STOREROOM DEPARTMENT.
           MOVE "DSTR" TO PLTINFOKEY  OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE SPACES                  TO  HOLD-DEPT-STR
           ELSE
               MOVE MPLTINFO-DEPT-STR (1)   TO  HOLD-DEPT-STR.

      *--------- GET PLANT NUMBER.
           MOVE "P 01" TO PLTINFOKEY  OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
      *--------- REPLACE CSIS PLANT CODE WITH SAP PLANT CODE.
           SET I TO 1.
           SEARCH PLANT-DATA-LINE
               AT END
                   MOVE "MPLTINFO PLANT NUMBER NOT VALID (P 01)"
                                           TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   MOVE MPLTINFO-COMPANY   TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                   PERFORM 200-BLOWUP
               WHEN CSIS-PLT-NO (I) = MPLTINFO-COMPANY
                   MOVE MPLTINFO-COMPANY   TO  HOLD-COMPANY
                   MOVE SAP-PLT-NO (I)     TO  HOLD-PLANT-CODE
                   MOVE SAP-PO-PREFIX (I)  TO  HOLD-PLT-ID
                   MOVE SAP-LEGACY-ID (I)  TO  HOLD-LEGACY-ID
                   MOVE ARIBA-ID (I)       TO  ARIBA-FLAG.
      *-------------------------------------------------------
      * Set plant pointer for Raw Material storage Departments
           MOVE 1 TO PLT-PTR.
           PERFORM UNTIL
               DEPT-PLT-ID (PLT-PTR) = HOLD-PLT-ID OR
               DEPT-PLT-ID (PLT-PTR) = SPACES OR
               PLT-PTR = 9
                   ADD 1 TO PLT-PTR
           END-PERFORM.

      *--------- LOAD STANDARD INSTRUCTIONS TO EXCLUDE FROM
      *--------- PURCHASE ORDER FILE.
           MOVE "N"                TO  INSTR-EOF-SW.
           SET J TO 1.
           INITIALIZE INSTR-TABLE.
           READ INSTR-FILE
               AT END MOVE "Y"     TO  INSTR-EOF-SW.
           PERFORM VARYING J FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL INSTR-EOF-SW = "Y"
               MOVE INSTR-REC      TO  INSTR-ENTRY (J)
               READ INSTR-FILE
                   AT END MOVE "Y" TO  INSTR-EOF-SW
               END-READ
           END-PERFORM.
           ACCEPT HDR-DATE FROM DATE.
           ACCEPT HDR-TIME FROM TIME.
           MOVE PLANT-NAME (PLT-PTR) TO PLANT-HDR.
      *    DISPLAY INSTR-TABLE.

       2-EOJ.
           MOVE SPACES TO PRINT-LINE.
           STRING "BLANKET ORDERS        = " BLK-RECS-CTR
                   DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO PRINT-LINE.
           PERFORM 980-PRINT-DATA.
           STRING "LOCAL CONTRACTS       = " CNT-RECS-CTR
                   DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO PRINT-LINE.
           PERFORM 980-PRINT-DATA.
           STRING "PURCHASE ORD/RELEASES = " PUR-RECS-CTR
                   DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO PRINT-LINE.
           PERFORM 980-PRINT-DATA.
           STRING "TOTAL RECORDS ON FILE = " TOT-RECS-CTR
                   DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO PRINT-LINE.
           PERFORM 980-PRINT-DATA.

           CLOSE DPORECD-I
                 DPOITEM-I
                 DPODATAITM-I
                 DINVRCD-I
                 DINVITM-I
                 DCOMMENT-I
                 MVALIDPLTDATA-I
                 INSTR-FILE
                 PRINT-FILE
                 BLANKET-FILE
                 CONTRACT-FILE
                 PURCH-FILE
                 UNCLASS-FILE.

       200-BLOWUP.
           PERFORM 2-EOJ.
           MOVE "TR3PURCH" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
               VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
               BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
           GOBACK.

       6-MAIN.
           PERFORM 9999-START-DPORECD-I.

       6-READ.
           PERFORM 9999-GETNEXT-DPORECD-I.
           IF DPORECD-EOF-SW = "Y"
               GO TO 6-MAIN-X.
           ADD 1 TO TOT-RECS-CTR.
           INITIALIZE H1-REC.
           INITIALIZE I1-REC.
           INITIALIZE H2-REC.
           INITIALIZE I2-REC.
           MOVE "I3" TO I2-REC-ID.
           MOVE "I1" TO I1-REC-ID.
           MOVE "H2" TO H2-REC-ID.
           MOVE "H1" TO H1-REC-ID.
           MOVE "N701" TO H1-PO-ORG.
           MOVE "EN" TO H1-LANG.

           SET NON-ARIBA-ORDER
               NON-PLANT-ORDER
               NON-T-AND-M-ORDER
               NON-REPAIR-ORDER TO TRUE.
      *------- SEE IF THIS IS A TIME & MATERIAL PO (SUFFIXED
      *------- WITH A "T"), A REPAIR & RETURN PO (SUFFIXED
      *------- WITH AN "M") OR AN ARIBA ORDER (2nd char of
      *------- PO = this plants Ariba assigned character)
           MOVE " "                 TO  TM-RR-PO-SW.
           PERFORM VARYING SUBT FROM 8 BY -1 UNTIL SUBT = 3
                                             OR    TM-RR-PO-SW > " "
               IF PO-RCV-NO (SUBT:1) = "T"
                   MOVE "T"         TO  TM-RR-PO-SW
                   SET T-AND-M-ORDER TO TRUE
               END-IF
               IF PO-RCV-NO (SUBT:1) = "M"
                   MOVE "R"         TO  TM-RR-PO-SW
                   SET REPAIR-ORDER TO TRUE
               END-IF
           END-PERFORM.
      *---------------------------------------------------------
      *  Is this an Ariba order or has the plant changed their
      *  PO numbering to use plant ID as first character.
      *---------------------------------------------------------
           IF PO-RCV-NO (2:1) = ARIBA-FLAG
               SET ARIBA-ORDER TO TRUE
           ELSE IF PO-RCV-NO (2:1) = HOLD-PLT-ID
               SET PLANT-ORDER TO TRUE.

      *------ SKIP "IT" REQUIREMENTS ORDERS.
           IF PO-RCV-NO (2:2) = "IT" AND PO-RLS-NO = "999"
               GO TO 6-READ.

      *------ SKIP "IT" ORDERS. NOW THEY WANT THEM!
      *-- TESTING IT LOAD FOR SALLY (6/28/2004)
      *    IF PO-RCV-NO (2:2) = "IT"
      *        NEXT SENTENCE
      *    ELSE
      *        GO TO 6-READ.

      *------ SKIP ORDERS FROM CORPORATE PURCHASING.
           IF PO-CO NOT = HOLD-COMPANY
               GO TO 6-READ.

      *------ DETERMINE IF BLANKET, LOCAL CONTRACT OR PURCHASE ORDER.
           IF PO-NON-RCV-INDIC = "X" OR TM-RR-PO-SW = "T"
               SET BLANKET-ORDER TO TRUE
      * Next three lines are for debugging only
      *        IF PO-RCV-NO (2:5) = "77017"
      *            MOVE 1 TO SUB
      *        END-IF
               PERFORM 60-BLANKET-ORDERS
           ELSE IF PO-RLS-NO = "999"
               SET LOCAL-ORDER TO TRUE
               PERFORM 70-LOCAL-ORDERS
           ELSE
               SET PURCHASE-ORDER TO TRUE
               PERFORM 80-PURCHASE-ORDERS.

      *    MOVE SPACES TO PRINT-REC.
      *    STRING "PURCHASE ORDER ", PO-RCV-NO
      *        " IS NON-RECEIVABLE"
      *        DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO PRINT-REC.
      *    WRITE PRINT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           GO TO 6-READ.

       6-MAIN-X.
           EXIT.
      /
      ****************************************************************
      ******           B L A N K E T   P O S                    ******
      ****************************************************************

      *------ ELIMINATE BLANKETS & LOCAL CONTRACTS WITH EXPECT DATE
      *------ PRIOR TO 2003.
      *--------- BLANKET POS (NON-RECEIVABLE).
       60-BLANKET-ORDERS.
           IF PO-DATE-CN > "20030000"
               PERFORM 923-CHECK-FOR-ITEMS
               IF OPEN-PO
                   SET HEADER-NEEDED TO TRUE
                   PERFORM 61-SET-H1-REC
                   PERFORM 63-WRITE-I1-REC
                   ADD 1 TO BLK-RECS-CTR.

       61-SET-H1-REC.
           PERFORM 901-SET-H1-COMMON.
           MOVE "FO  "              TO  H1-ORDER-TYPE.
           STRING PO-DATE-CC PO-DATE-YY "0101"
               DELIMITED BY SIZE  INTO  H1-START-DATE.
           MOVE 0                   TO  H1-DLV-VALUE.
           PERFORM 930-COMPUTE-DLV-VAL.
           COMPUTE H1-DLV-VALUE ROUNDED = HOLD-DLV-TOT-VAL.
           PERFORM 931-COMPUTE-INV-VAL.
           COMPUTE H1-INV-VALUE ROUNDED = HOLD-INV-TOT-VAL.
           MOVE PO-BUDGET-NUMBER    TO  H1-BUDGET-NUM.

           IF NUM-ITEMS > 1 AND BLANKET-ITEMS > 0
               MOVE SPACES TO PRINT-LINE
               STRING "* FO" PO-RCV-NO (2:13) " BUDGET AMOUNT SPLIT"
                   DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO PRINT-LINE
               PERFORM 980-PRINT-DATA
           END-IF.


       63-WRITE-I1-REC.
           PERFORM 9999-START-DPOITEM-I.
           PERFORM 9999-GETNEXT-DPOITEM-I.
           PERFORM 630-WRITE-ITEMS UNTIL ITM-PO-RCV-NO NOT = PO-ARG
                                   OR    FILE-STATUS NOT = "00".

       630-WRITE-ITEMS.
           IF ITM-QTY-ORD > ITM-QTY-PAID OR
              ITM-QTY-ORD = ZERO
               IF HEADER-NEEDED
                   WRITE BLANKET-REC  FROM  H1-REC
                   SET H1-WRITTEN TO TRUE
                   PERFORM 64-WRITE-H2-REC
               END-IF
               PERFORM 631-WRITE-I1.

           PERFORM 9999-GETNEXT-DPOITEM-I.

       631-WRITE-I1.
           MOVE "B"                   TO  I1-CATEGORY.
           IF ITM-CORP-CODE NOT = "NON-STR"
               MOVE ITM-CORP-CODE     TO  CODE-ARG
               PERFORM 9999-READ-MSTORERM-I.
      * Moved Perform 902-SET-I1-COMMON down below where the
      * account assignment flag is set as it needs to be set
      * before execution 902-.               H. Proctor  5/3/04
      *    IF ITM-QTY-ORD = 0 AND ITM-UNIT-PRICE = 0
      *        MOVE SPACES            TO  I1-PO-QTY-R
      *                                   I1-PRICE-R
      *                                   I1-PRICE-UNIT-R.
      * ALWAYS SEND ZEROS FOR BLANKET PRICE AND QUANTITY.
           MOVE ZEROS                 TO  I1-PO-QTY
                                          I1-PRICE-UNIT.
           MOVE ITM-UM                TO  I1-UM.
           MOVE ITM-PRICE-UM          TO  I1-PRICE-UM.
      *---------- ALWAYS MAKE ACCOUNT ASSIGNMENT = K FOR BLANKETS.
           MOVE "K"                   TO  I1-ACCT-ASSIGN.
           MOVE SPACES                TO  I1-MATL-NUM.
           PERFORM 902-SET-I1-COMMON.
      **** MOVE I1-ACCOUNT-NUM        TO  I1-COST-CENTER.

      *-----Peference Qty * Price but if 0 then use Budget amount
      *    IF PO-BUDGET-AMT > 0
      *        IF NUM-ITEMS = 1
      *            MOVE PO-BUDGET-AMT      TO  I1-OVERALL-LIMIT
      *                                        I1-EXP-VALUE
      *        ELSE
                   IF ITM-QTY-ORD = 0 OR ITM-UNIT-PRICE = 0
                       COMPUTE I1-OVERALL-LIMIT ROUNDED =
                                      (PO-BUDGET-AMT - STND-BUDGET-AMT)
                                                     / BLANKET-ITEMS
                       MOVE I1-OVERALL-LIMIT   TO  I1-EXP-VALUE
                   ELSE
                       COMPUTE I1-OVERALL-LIMIT ROUNDED = ITM-QTY-ORD
                                                    * ITM-UNIT-PRICE
                       MOVE I1-OVERALL-LIMIT   TO  I1-EXP-VALUE.
      *    ELSE
      *        COMPUTE I1-OVERALL-LIMIT ROUNDED = ITM-UNIT-PRICE
      *                                         * ITM-QTY-ORD
      *        MOVE I1-OVERALL-LIMIT           TO I1-EXP-VALUE.


           MOVE SPACES                TO  I1-DLV-QTY-R
                                          I1-INV-QTY-R.
           PERFORM 932-COMPUTE-INV-ITM-VAL.
           COMPUTE I1-INV-VALUE ROUNDED = HOLD-INV-ITM-TOT.
           WRITE BLANKET-REC FROM I1-REC.
      * Print error messages if these condition exists
           MOVE SPACES TO PRINT-LINE.
           IF I1-OVERALL-LIMIT = ZERO
               STRING "* FO " PO-RCV-NO (2:13)
                      " ITEM " ITM-NUMBER " HAS ZERO VALUE"
                   DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO PRINT-LINE
               PERFORM 980-PRINT-DATA
           ELSE IF I1-OVERALL-LIMIT < I1-INV-VALUE
               STRING "* FO " PO-RCV-NO (2:13)
                      " ITEM " ITM-NUMBER " LIMIT IS < INV-VALUE."
                   DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO PRINT-LINE
               PERFORM 980-PRINT-DATA.
           PERFORM 910-WRITE-I2-REC.
           MOVE "00"                  TO  FILE-STATUS.

       64-WRITE-H2-REC.
           MOVE PO-RCV-NO           TO  PO-ARG.
           MOVE HOLD-PO-NUM         TO  H2-PO-NUM.
           PERFORM 9999-GET-DPODATAITM.
           PERFORM 640-WRITE-INSTR
               VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL SUB > 12.

       640-WRITE-INSTR.
           IF STD-INST-NO (SUB) > SPACES
             PERFORM 991-SEARCH-INSTR-TABLE
             IF EXCLUDE-INSTR-SW = "N"
               MOVE STD-INST-NO (SUB)   TO  BUILD-COM-NO
               MOVE BUILD-COMMENT-NO    TO  COMMENT-ARG
               MOVE COMMENT-ARG TO MCOMCOMMNT OF DCOMMENT-REC-I
               PERFORM 9999-START-DCOMMENT
               IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                   PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DCOMMENT
                   PERFORM UNTIL DCOM-COMMENT-NO NOT = COMMENT-ARG
                           OR    FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                       PERFORM 924-CHECK-TYPE
                       MOVE HOLD-TEXT   TO  H2-TEXT
                       WRITE BLANKET-REC FROM H2-REC
                       PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DCOMMENT
                   END-PERFORM
               END-IF.

      /***************************************************************
      ******           L O C A L   C O N T R A C T S            ******
      ****************************************************************

      *------ ELIMINATE BLANKETS & LOCAL CONTRACTS WITH EXPECT DATE
      *------ PRIOR TO 2003.
      *--------- LOCAL CONTRACTS (REQUIREMENT ORDERS).
       70-LOCAL-ORDERS.
           IF PO-EXPECT-DATE-CN > "20040000"
               PERFORM 923-CHECK-FOR-ITEMS
               IF OPEN-PO
                   PERFORM 71-WRITE-H1-REC
                   PERFORM 72-WRITE-H2-REC
                   PERFORM 73-WRITE-I1-REC
                   ADD 1 TO CNT-RECS-CTR.

       71-WRITE-H1-REC.
           PERFORM 901-SET-H1-COMMON.
      *-------------- Don't include "999" in PO Num in local contracts.
      *    MOVE SPACES TO HOLD-RLS.
           MOVE HOLD-PO-NUM         TO  H1-PO-NUM.
           MOVE "LC  "              TO  H1-ORDER-TYPE.
           STRING PO-DATE-CC PO-DATE-YY "0101"
               DELIMITED BY SIZE  INTO  H1-START-DATE.
           MOVE 0                   TO  H1-DLV-VALUE
                                        H1-INV-VALUE.
           MOVE PO-BUDGET-NUMBER    TO  H1-BUDGET-NUM.
           WRITE CONTRACT-REC FROM H1-REC.

       72-WRITE-H2-REC.
           MOVE PO-RCV-NO           TO  PO-ARG.
           MOVE HOLD-PO-NUM         TO  H2-PO-NUM.
           PERFORM 9999-GET-DPODATAITM.
           PERFORM 720-WRITE-INSTR
               VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL SUB > 12.

       720-WRITE-INSTR.
           IF STD-INST-NO (SUB) > SPACES
             PERFORM 991-SEARCH-INSTR-TABLE
             IF EXCLUDE-INSTR-SW = "N"
               MOVE STD-INST-NO (SUB)   TO  BUILD-COM-NO
               MOVE BUILD-COMMENT-NO    TO  COMMENT-ARG
               MOVE COMMENT-ARG TO MCOMCOMMNT OF DCOMMENT-REC-I
               PERFORM 9999-START-DCOMMENT
               IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                   PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DCOMMENT
                   PERFORM UNTIL DCOM-COMMENT-NO NOT = COMMENT-ARG
                           OR    FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                       PERFORM 924-CHECK-TYPE
                       MOVE HOLD-TEXT   TO  H2-TEXT
                       WRITE CONTRACT-REC FROM H2-REC
                       PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DCOMMENT
                   END-PERFORM
               END-IF.

       73-WRITE-I1-REC.
           PERFORM 9999-START-DPOITEM-I.
           PERFORM 9999-GETNEXT-DPOITEM-I.
           PERFORM 730-WRITE-ITEMS UNTIL ITM-PO-RCV-NO NOT = PO-ARG
                                   OR    FILE-STATUS NOT = "00".

       730-WRITE-ITEMS.
      *----SET CATEGORY TO "K" FOR CONSIGNMENT CODES
      *    IF ITM-CORP-CODE = "NON-STR"
      *        MOVE SPACES            TO  I1-MATL-NUM
      *                                   I1-CATEGORY
      *    ELSE
      *        MOVE ITM-CORP-CODE     TO  I1-MATL-NUM
      *        PERFORM 9999-READ-MSTORERM-I
      *        IF ON-CONSIGNMENT
      *            MOVE "K"           TO  I1-CATEGORY
      *        ELSE
      *            MOVE SPACES        TO  I1-CATEGORY.
      *---------- LEAVE ACCOUNT CATEGORY BLANK FOR CONTRACTS.
      *    MOVE " "                   TO  I1-ACCT-ASSIGN.
      * Next three lines are for debugging only
      *        IF PO-RCV-NO (2:5) = "77461"
      *            MOVE 1 TO SUB
      *        END-IF
           PERFORM 900-SET-CATEGORY-ACCT-ASSIGN.
           PERFORM 902-SET-I1-COMMON.
           PERFORM 903-CONVERT-PRICE.
           IF I1-PRICE = ZERO
               MOVE .01 TO I1-PRICE.
      **** MOVE I1-ACCOUNT-NUM        TO  I1-COST-CENTER.

           MOVE SPACES                TO  I1-OVERALL-LIMIT-R
                                          I1-EXP-VALUE-R.
           MOVE ITM-QTY-DLVR          TO  I1-DLV-QTY.
           MOVE ITM-QTY-PAID          TO  I1-INV-QTY.
           WRITE CONTRACT-REC FROM I1-REC.
      * Print error report if embeded spaces in accounting info
           IF I1-ACCT-ASSIGN NOT = " "
               MOVE SPACES TO PRINT-LINE
               MOVE 0 TO SUB
               INSPECT I1-ACCOUNT-NUM TALLYING SUB FOR ALL SPACES
               IF SUB > 0
                   STRING "* LC " PO-RCV-NO (2:13)
                          " ITEM " ITM-NUMBER
                          " ACCT# " I1-ACCOUNT-NUM " HAS EMBEDED SPACES"
                       DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO PRINT-LINE
                   PERFORM 980-PRINT-DATA.
           PERFORM 910-WRITE-I2-REC.
           MOVE "00"                  TO  FILE-STATUS.
           PERFORM 9999-GETNEXT-DPOITEM-I.

      /***************************************************************
      ******  P U R C H A S E   O R D E R S / R E L E A S E S   ******
      ****************************************************************

      *--------- PURCHASE ORDERS & RELEASES.
       80-PURCHASE-ORDERS.
           SET HEADER-NEEDED TO TRUE.
           PERFORM 922-CHECK-OPEN-PO.
           IF OPEN-PO
               PERFORM 81-SET-H1-REC
               IF OPEN-PO
                   PERFORM 83-WRITE-I1-REC
                   ADD 1 TO PUR-RECS-CTR.

       81-SET-H1-REC.
           PERFORM 901-SET-H1-COMMON.
      *    IF TM-RR-PO-SW = "R"
      *        MOVE "RR  "          TO  H1-ORDER-TYPE
      *    ELSE
               MOVE "NB  "          TO  H1-ORDER-TYPE.
           MOVE PO-DATE-CN          TO  H1-START-DATE.
           PERFORM 930-COMPUTE-DLV-VAL.
           COMPUTE H1-DLV-VALUE ROUNDED = HOLD-DLV-TOT-VAL.
           PERFORM 931-COMPUTE-INV-VAL.
           COMPUTE H1-INV-VALUE ROUNDED = HOLD-INV-TOT-VAL.
           MOVE PO-BUDGET-NUMBER    TO  H1-BUDGET-NUM.
      *---REMOVED BUDGET CHECKS, USER CAN MODIFY TO ANY AMOUNT.
      *    IF HOLD-INV-TOT-VAL >= (PO-BUDGET-AMT - 1)
      *        MOVE "N"            TO  OPEN-PO-SW
      *    ELSE
           IF PO-DATE-CN < "20030000"
               MOVE "N"            TO  OPEN-PO-SW
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-INV-TOT-VAL = 0 AND PO-DATE-CN < "20030000"
               MOVE "N"            TO  OPEN-PO-SW
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-INV-TOT-VAL > 0 AND PO-LAST-PAYMENT-CN < "200200"
               MOVE "N"            TO  OPEN-PO-SW.

       83-WRITE-I1-REC.
           PERFORM 9999-START-DPOITEM-I.
           PERFORM 9999-GETNEXT-DPOITEM-I.
           PERFORM 830-WRITE-ITEMS UNTIL ITM-PO-RCV-NO NOT = PO-ARG
                                   OR    FILE-STATUS NOT = "00".

       830-WRITE-ITEMS.
      * New code to test for Open Item.
      * BYPASS ARIBA AND REPAIR ITEMS WITH ZERO QTY (OR PRICE)
           IF ARIBA-ORDER AND
              ITM-QTY-ORD = ZERO
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               IF REPAIR-ORDER AND
                  ITM-QTY-ORD = ZERO AND
                  ITM-UNIT-PRICE = ZERO
                   NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
                   IF ITM-QTY-ORD > ITM-QTY-DLVR OR
                      ITM-QTY-DLVR > ITM-QTY-PAID OR
                      ITM-QTY-ORD < .001
                       PERFORM 831-WRITE-ITEMS.

           PERFORM 9999-GETNEXT-DPOITEM-I.

       831-WRITE-ITEMS.
           IF HEADER-NEEDED
               PERFORM 840-WRITE-H1-REC.
           PERFORM 900-SET-CATEGORY-ACCT-ASSIGN.
           PERFORM 902-SET-I1-COMMON.
      * INSERT TEST OF I1-SHORT-TEXT TEST HERE
           IF ARIBA-ORDER
               MOVE I1-SHORT-TEXT TO TEXT-40
               PERFORM 925-CHECK-TEXT
                       VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL SUB > 40
               MOVE TEXT-40 TO I1-SHORT-TEXT.
           PERFORM 903-CONVERT-PRICE.
      **** MOVE I1-ACCOUNT-NUM        TO  I1-COST-CENTER.

           IF PO-INVOICELESS-IND = "X" OR PO-INVOICELESS-IND = "Y"
               MOVE "X"               TO  I1-INV-IND1
                                          I1-INV-IND2
           MOVE SPACES                TO  I1-OVERALL-LIMIT-R
                                          I1-EXP-VALUE-R.
           MOVE ITM-QTY-DLVR          TO  I1-DLV-QTY.
           MOVE ITM-QTY-PAID          TO  I1-INV-QTY.
           COMPUTE I1-DLV-VALUE ROUNDED = ITM-QTY-DLVR
                                        * ITM-UNIT-PRICE.
           PERFORM 932-COMPUTE-INV-ITM-VAL.
           COMPUTE I1-INV-VALUE ROUNDED = HOLD-INV-ITM-TOT.
           IF UNCLASS-PO-SW = "Y"
               WRITE UNCLASS-REC FROM I1-REC
           ELSE
               WRITE PURCH-REC   FROM I1-REC.
      * Print error report if incomplete accounting info
           IF I1-ACCT-ASSIGN NOT = " "
               MOVE SPACES TO PRINT-LINE
               MOVE 0 TO SUB
               INSPECT I1-ACCOUNT-NUM TALLYING SUB FOR ALL SPACES
               IF SUB > 0
                   STRING "* PO " PO-RCV-NO (2:13)
                          " ITEM " ITM-NUMBER
                          " ACCT# " I1-ACCOUNT-NUM " HAS EMBEDED SPACES"
                       DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO PRINT-LINE
                   PERFORM 980-PRINT-DATA.
           PERFORM 910-WRITE-I2-REC.
           MOVE "00"                  TO  FILE-STATUS.

       840-WRITE-H1-REC.
           IF OPEN-PO
               IF UNCLASS-PO-SW = "Y"
                   WRITE UNCLASS-REC   FROM H1-REC
               ELSE
                   WRITE PURCH-REC     FROM H1-REC.
           SET H1-WRITTEN TO TRUE.
           PERFORM 841-WRITE-H2-REC.

       841-WRITE-H2-REC.
           MOVE PO-RCV-NO           TO  PO-ARG.
           MOVE HOLD-PO-NUM         TO  H2-PO-NUM.
           PERFORM 9999-GET-DPODATAITM.
           PERFORM 842-WRITE-INSTR
               VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL SUB > 12.

       842-WRITE-INSTR.
           IF STD-INST-NO (SUB) > SPACES
             PERFORM 991-SEARCH-INSTR-TABLE
             IF EXCLUDE-INSTR-SW = "N"
               MOVE STD-INST-NO (SUB)   TO  BUILD-COM-NO
               MOVE BUILD-COMMENT-NO    TO  COMMENT-ARG
               MOVE COMMENT-ARG TO MCOMCOMMNT OF DCOMMENT-REC-I
               PERFORM 9999-START-DCOMMENT
               IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                   PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DCOMMENT
                   PERFORM UNTIL DCOM-COMMENT-NO NOT = COMMENT-ARG
                           OR    FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                       PERFORM 924-CHECK-TYPE
                       MOVE HOLD-TEXT   TO  H2-TEXT
                       IF UNCLASS-PO-SW = "Y"
                           WRITE UNCLASS-REC FROM H2-REC
                       ELSE
                           WRITE PURCH-REC   FROM H2-REC
                       END-IF
                       PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DCOMMENT
                   END-PERFORM
               END-IF.

      /**************************************************************
      ** C O M M O N   P A R A G R A P H S                         **
      ***************************************************************

       900-SET-CATEGORY-ACCT-ASSIGN.
           IF ITM-CORP-CODE = "NON-STR"
               MOVE SPACES            TO  I1-MATL-NUM
           ELSE
               MOVE ITM-CORP-CODE     TO  I1-MATL-NUM
                                          CODE-ARG.
           SET NOT-RAW-MATERIAL TO TRUE.
           IF ITM-CORP-CODE-1-2 = "26" OR
              ITM-CORP-CODE-1-2 = "27" OR
              ITM-CORP-CODE-1-2 = "28" OR
              ITM-CORP-CODE-1-2 = "29"
                  SET RAW-MATERIAL TO TRUE.
      *---------------------------------------------------------
      *  Does the Department on this PO store Raw Material?
      *---------------------------------------------------------
           SET NON-RM-DEPT TO TRUE.
           IF DEPT-PLT-ID (PLT-PTR) NOT = SPACES
               MOVE 1 TO DEPT-PTR
               PERFORM UNTIL ITM-SUB-DETL = DEPT-ID (PLT-PTR, DEPT-PTR)
                          OR DEPT-ID (PLT-PTR, DEPT-PTR) = SPACES
                          OR DEPT-PTR = 6
                              ADD 1 TO DEPT-PTR
               END-PERFORM
               IF DEPT-ID (PLT-PTR, DEPT-PTR) = ITM-SUB-DETL
                   SET RM-DEPT TO TRUE.
      *----------- IF ITEM FOR STOREROOM DEPARTMENT, MOVE SPACE
      *----------- TO ACCOUNT ASSIGNMENT; OTHERWISE, MOVE "K".
           PERFORM 9999-READ-MSTORERM-I.
           MOVE " "           TO  I1-ACCT-ASSIGN
                                  I1-CATEGORY.
           IF ITM-SUB-DETL = HOLD-DEPT-STR
               IF ON-CONSIGNMENT
                   MOVE "K"           TO  I1-CATEGORY
               END-IF
      *    -- If department this order is for stores Raw Material
      *    -- and this is a Raw Material order.
           ELSE IF RM-DEPT AND RAW-MATERIAL
               IF ON-CONSIGNMENT
                   MOVE "K"           TO  I1-CATEGORY
               END-IF
           ELSE
               MOVE "K"               TO  I1-ACCT-ASSIGN
           END-IF.

      **********************************************************
      *  If Ariba order pass assigned PO number to SAP else
      *  put Plant ID on front of PO number.  If number is
      *  7 characters, truncate first character.
      *    Note that the String statement for Purchase Orders
      *  was delimited by SPACE instead of SIZE before the
      *  change made 2/26/04.
      **********************************************************
       901-SET-H1-COMMON.
           PERFORM 904-CONVERT-PO-NUM.
           MOVE HOLD-PO-NUM         TO  H1-PO-NUM.
           MOVE HOLD-LEGACY-ID      TO  H1-LEGACY-ID.

           MOVE PO-VEN-CODE         TO  H1-VENDOR.
           MOVE PO-DATE-CN          TO  H1-PO-DATE.
           IF PO-RCV-NO (2:2) = "IT"
              MOVE "STO "           TO  H1-PO-BUYER
           ELSE
              MOVE PO-BUYER-CODE    TO  H1-PO-BUYER.
           MOVE HOLD-PLANT-CODE     TO  H1-PLANT.

           MOVE PO-EXPECT-DATE-CN   TO  H1-END-DATE.
           MOVE PO-TERMS            TO  H1-TERMS.
           PERFORM 941-FIND-CURRENCY.
           IF PO-FREIGHT-TERMS = SPACES
               MOVE "P"             TO  H1-FREIGHT
           ELSE
               MOVE PO-FREIGHT-TERMS TO H1-FREIGHT.

           IF PO-FOB = SPACES
               MOVE "DESTINATION"   TO  H1-FOB
           ELSE
               MOVE PO-FOB          TO  H1-FOB.
           MOVE PO-BUDGET-AMT       TO  H1-PO-VALUE.

       902-SET-I1-COMMON.
           MOVE SPACES TO FULL-TEXT.
           MOVE HOLD-PO-NUM           TO  I1-PO-NUM.
           STRING ITM-NUMBER "0"
               DELIMITED BY SIZE    INTO  I1-ITEM-NO-R.
           PERFORM 905-MOVE-MATL-GRP.
           MOVE SPACES                TO  I1-NEW-WORK.
      *---ONLY SEND ACCOUNT NUMBER IF ACCOUNT ASSIGNMENT IS "K".
           IF I1-ACCT-ASSIGN = "K"
      * CONVERTED STRING TO MOVES FOR MORE CONTROL AND CLARITY
      *        STRING PO-CO PO-PRIME ITM-ADDL-DATA (4:3) ITM-SUB-DETL
      *               ITM-ADDL-DATA (2:5)
      *            DELIMITED BY SIZE
      *            INTO  I1-ACCOUNT-NUM
               MOVE PO-CO                    TO I1-CO
               MOVE PO-PRIME                 TO I1-PRIME
               IF ITM-ADDL-DATA < "000100"
                   MOVE "250"                TO I1-CLASS
               ELSE
                   MOVE ITM-ADDL-DATA (4:3)  TO I1-CLASS
               END-IF
               MOVE ITM-SUB-DETL             TO I1-DEPT

               PERFORM 921-CHECK-NEW-WORK
           ELSE
               MOVE SPACES            TO  I1-ACCOUNT-NUM.

           MOVE SPACES                TO  I1-SHORT-TEXT.
           IF ITM-CORP-CODE = "NON-STR"
               STRING ITM-NUMBER "01"
                   DELIMITED BY SIZE  INTO ITEMSEQNO OF DPODATAITM-REC-I
               PERFORM 9999-GET-FIRST-DPODATAITM
               IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                   PERFORM 920-CHECK-SHORT-TEXT
               ELSE
                    MOVE SPACES       TO  HOLD-SHORT-TEXT.

           IF PO-RLS-NO = "999" OR PO-NON-RCV-INDIC = "X"
               MOVE SPACES            TO  I1-REC-IND
           ELSE
               MOVE "X"               TO  I1-REC-IND.

           IF ITM-TAX-CODE = SPACES
               IF ITM-CORP-CODE = "NON-STR"  OR
                  STR-TAX-CODE = SPACES
                   MOVE DFT-TAX-CODE  TO  I1-TAX-CODE
               ELSE
                   MOVE STR-TAX-CODE  TO  I1-TAX-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE ITM-TAX-CODE      TO  I1-TAX-CODE.

           MOVE SPACES                TO  I1-INV-IND1
                                          I1-INV-IND2.

       903-CONVERT-PRICE.
           COMPUTE I1-PO-QTY ROUNDED = ITM-QTY-ORD.
           MOVE ITM-UM                TO  I1-UM.
           MOVE ITM-UNIT-PRICE        TO  HOLD-UNIT-PRICE.
           IF HOLD-UNIT-PRICE (14:2) = "00"
               COMPUTE I1-PRICE  ROUNDED = ITM-UNIT-PRICE
               MOVE 1                 TO  I1-PRICE-UNIT
           ELSE
               COMPUTE I1-PRICE = ITM-UNIT-PRICE * 100
               MOVE 100               TO  I1-PRICE-UNIT.
           MOVE ITM-PRICE-UM          TO  I1-PRICE-UM.

       904-CONVERT-PO-NUM.
           MOVE SPACES TO HOLD-PO-NUM.
           IF ARIBA-ORDER OR PLANT-ORDER
               STRING PO-RCV-NO (2:7) PO-RLS-NO
                                    DELIMITED BY SIZE
                                    INTO  HOLD-PO-NUM
           ELSE IF PO-RCV-NO (8:1) = SPACE
               STRING HOLD-PLT-ID PO-RCV-NO (2:6) PO-RLS-NO
                                    DELIMITED BY SIZE
                                    INTO  HOLD-PO-NUM
           ELSE
               IF PO-RLS-NO = "000"
      *           PO-RLS-NO = "999"
                   STRING HOLD-PLT-ID PO-RCV-NO (2:7)
                                        DELIMITED BY SIZE
                                        INTO  HOLD-PO-NUM
               ELSE
      * Insert VF logic here
                   STRING HOLD-PLT-ID PO-RCV-NO (3:6) PO-RLS-NO
                                        DELIMITED BY SIZE
                                        INTO  HOLD-PO-NUM.
           IF HOLD-RLS = "000" OR
              HOLD-RLS = "999"
               MOVE SPACES          TO  HOLD-RLS.

       905-MOVE-MATL-GRP.
           MOVE SPACES                TO  I1-MATL-GRP.
           IF ITM-CORP-CODE = "NON-STR"
               MOVE "ZMMIS   "        TO  I1-MATL-GRP
           ELSE
               STRING "C" ITM-CORP-CODE (1:2) DELIMITED BY SIZE
                                    INTO  I1-MATL-GRP.

       910-WRITE-I2-REC.
           MOVE SPACES TO FULL-TEXT.
           MOVE HOLD-PO-NUM           TO  I2-PO-NUM.
           STRING ITM-NUMBER "0"
               DELIMITED BY SIZE    INTO  I2-ITEM-NO-R.
           IF HOLD-SHORT-TEXT > SPACES
               MOVE HOLD-SHORT-TEXT      TO  I2-TEXT
               PERFORM 913-WRITE-REC
               MOVE SPACES               TO  HOLD-SHORT-TEXT.
           PERFORM 9999-START-DPODATAITM.
           PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DPODATAITM.
           PERFORM 911-WRITE-ITEM-DESC
               UNTIL PORCVNO OF DPODATAITM-REC-I NOT = PO-ARG
               OR    DATAITM-ITEM-NO > ITM-NUMBER
               OR    FILE-STATUS NOT = "00".
           IF ITM-STD-INST > SPACES
               MOVE ITM-STD-INST         TO  SAVE-STD-INST-LIST
               PERFORM 912-WRITE-INSTR
                   VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL SUB > 4.

       911-WRITE-ITEM-DESC.
           MOVE SPACES                           TO I2-TEXT.
           IF DATAITM-ITEM-NO = ITM-NUMBER AND DATAITM-LINE-NO > "01"
      *------------- BREAK ITEM DESCRIPTION LINES INTO 40-CHARACTER
      *------------- SEGMENTS.
               IF DATAITM-INFO (41:40) = SPACES
                   MOVE DATAITM-INFO             TO  I2-TEXT
                   PERFORM 913-WRITE-REC
               ELSE
                   PERFORM 990-DO-NOTHING VARYING SUB2 FROM 40 BY -1
                               UNTIL DATAITM-INFO (SUB2:1) = " "
                               OR    SUB2 = 1
                   IF SUB2 = 1
                       MOVE 40                   TO  SUB2
                   END-IF
                   MOVE DATAITM-INFO (1:SUB2)    TO  I2-TEXT
                   PERFORM 913-WRITE-REC
                   MOVE SPACES                   TO  I2-TEXT
                   ADD 1                         TO  SUB2
                   COMPUTE SUB3 = 80 - SUB2 + 1
                   MOVE DATAITM-INFO (SUB2:SUB3) TO  I2-TEXT
                   PERFORM 913-WRITE-REC.
           PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DPODATAITM.

       912-WRITE-INSTR.
           IF STD-INST-NO (SUB) > SPACES
             PERFORM 991-SEARCH-INSTR-TABLE
             IF EXCLUDE-INSTR-SW = "N"
               MOVE STD-INST-NO (SUB)   TO  BUILD-COM-NO
               MOVE BUILD-COMMENT-NO    TO  COMMENT-ARG
               MOVE COMMENT-ARG TO MCOMCOMMNT OF DCOMMENT-REC-I
               PERFORM 9999-START-DCOMMENT
               IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                   PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DCOMMENT
                   PERFORM UNTIL DCOM-COMMENT-NO NOT = COMMENT-ARG
                           OR    FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                       PERFORM 924-CHECK-TYPE
                       MOVE HOLD-TEXT   TO  I2-TEXT
                       EVALUATE PO-TYPE-ANS
                           WHEN "B"  WRITE BLANKET-REC FROM I2-REC
                           WHEN "L"  WRITE CONTRACT-REC FROM I2-REC
                           WHEN "P"
                               IF UNCLASS-PO-SW = "Y"
                                   WRITE UNCLASS-REC FROM I2-REC
                               ELSE
                                   WRITE PURCH-REC   FROM I2-REC
                               END-IF
                       END-EVALUATE
                       PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DCOMMENT
                   END-PERFORM
               END-IF.

      * Inserted code to replace bad text if Ariba order
       913-WRITE-REC.
           IF ARIBA-ORDER
               MOVE I2-TEXT TO FULL-TEXT
               PERFORM 925-CHECK-TEXT
                       VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL SUB > 72
               MOVE FULL-TEXT TO I2-TEXT.
           EVALUATE PO-TYPE-ANS
               WHEN "B"    WRITE BLANKET-REC FROM I2-REC
               WHEN "L"    WRITE CONTRACT-REC FROM I2-REC
               WHEN "P"
                   IF UNCLASS-PO-SW = "Y"
                       WRITE UNCLASS-REC FROM I2-REC
                   ELSE
                       WRITE PURCH-REC   FROM I2-REC
                   END-IF.

       920-CHECK-SHORT-TEXT.
           IF DATAITM-INFO (41:40) = SPACES
               MOVE DATAITM-INFO             TO  I1-SHORT-TEXT
               MOVE SPACES                   TO  HOLD-SHORT-TEXT
           ELSE
               PERFORM 990-DO-NOTHING VARYING SUB2 FROM 40 BY -1
                               UNTIL DATAITM-INFO (SUB2:1) = " "
                               OR    SUB2 = 1
               IF SUB2 = 1
                   MOVE 40                   TO  SUB2
               END-IF
               MOVE DATAITM-INFO (1:SUB2)    TO  I1-SHORT-TEXT
               ADD 1                         TO  SUB2
               COMPUTE SUB3 = 80 - SUB2 + 1
               MOVE DATAITM-INFO (SUB2:SUB3) TO  HOLD-SHORT-TEXT.

       921-CHECK-NEW-WORK.
           MOVE ITM-ADDL-DATA         TO  NEW-WORK.
           MOVE BUILD-NEW-WORK        TO  MVALIDPLT-ARG.
           MOVE MVALIDPLT-ARG TO VALDTAKEY OF MVALIDPLTDATA-REC-I.
           START MVALIDPLTDATA-I KEY = VALDTAKEY OF MVALIDPLTDATA-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE "250"               TO I1-CLASS
               MOVE ITM-ADDL-DATA       TO I1-NEW-WORK
               MOVE "F"                 TO I1-ACCT-ASSIGN
               MOVE ZEROS               TO I1-ADDL-DATA
           ELSE
               MOVE ITM-ADDL-DATA (2:5) TO I1-ADDL-DATA.

       922-CHECK-OPEN-PO.
           MOVE PO-RCV-NO           TO  PO-ARG.
           MOVE "N"                 TO  OPEN-PO-SW
                                        UNCLASS-PO-SW.
           MOVE 0                   TO  ACCUM-PRICE
                                        ACCUM-ORD-QTY.
           PERFORM 9999-START-DPOITEM-I.
           PERFORM 9999-GETNEXT-DPOITEM-I.
           PERFORM UNTIL FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                      OR ITM-PO-RCV-NO > PO-ARG
               IF ITM-QTY-ORD > ITM-QTY-DLVR OR
                  ITM-QTY-DLVR > ITM-QTY-PAID OR
                  ITM-QTY-ORD < .001
                   MOVE "Y"         TO OPEN-PO-SW
               END-IF
      *------------- INSTEAD OF CHECKING FOR 0, CHECK TO SEE IF THE
      *------------- QUANTITY IS < .001.  THE SYNERGY CONVERSION FILE
      *------------- ONLY HAS 3 DECIMAL PLACES FOR THIS FIELD, SO THE
      *------------- PO NEEDS TO BE MOVED TO THE UNCLASSIFIED FILE.
               IF ITM-QTY-ORD < .001
                   IF ARIBA-ORDER
                       NEXT SENTENCE
                   ELSE
                       IF ITM-UNIT-PRICE = ZERO
                           IF REPAIR-ORDER
                                CONTINUE
      *                         NEXT SENTENCE
                           ELSE
                               MOVE "Y" TO UNCLASS-PO-SW
                           END-IF
                       ELSE
                           MOVE "Y"     TO UNCLASS-PO-SW
                       END-IF
                   END-IF
               ELSE
                   IF ITM-UNIT-PRICE = ZERO
                       MOVE "Y"         TO UNCLASS-PO-SW
                   END-IF
               END-IF
               ADD ITM-QTY-ORD      TO  ACCUM-ORD-QTY
               ADD ITM-UNIT-PRICE   TO  ACCUM-PRICE
               PERFORM 9999-GETNEXT-DPOITEM-I
           END-PERFORM.
           IF REPAIR-ORDER AND
              ACCUM-ORD-QTY = 0 AND
              ACCUM-PRICE = 0
                 MOVE "N" TO OPEN-PO-SW.
           IF ARIBA-ORDER AND
              ACCUM-ORD-QTY = 0
                 MOVE "N" TO OPEN-PO-SW.

      *---------- ELIMINATE PURCH ORDERS WITH NO ITEMS.
       923-CHECK-FOR-ITEMS.
           MOVE 0                   TO  NUM-ITEMS
                                        BLANKET-ITEMS
                                        STND-BUDGET-AMT.
           MOVE PO-RCV-NO           TO  PO-ARG.
           MOVE "N"                 TO  OPEN-PO-SW.
           PERFORM 9999-START-DPOITEM-I.
           PERFORM 9999-GETNEXT-DPOITEM-I.
           PERFORM UNTIL ITM-PO-RCV-NO NOT = PO-ARG OR
                                             FILE-STATUS > "00"
               ADD 1                TO  NUM-ITEMS
               IF ITM-QTY-ORD = 0 OR ITM-UNIT-PRICE = 0
                   ADD 1            TO  BLANKET-ITEMS
               ELSE
                   COMPUTE STND-BUDGET-AMT = STND-BUDGET-AMT
                             + (ITM-QTY-ORD * ITM-UNIT-PRICE)
               END-IF
               IF PO-RLS-NO = "999"
                   MOVE "Y" TO OPEN-PO-SW
               ELSE
                   IF ITM-QTY-ORD > ITM-QTY-PAID
                      MOVE "Y" TO OPEN-PO-SW
                   END-IF
               END-IF
               PERFORM 9999-GETNEXT-DPOITEM-I
           END-PERFORM.

       924-CHECK-TYPE.
           IF EXP-PRT-START = "*EXP*"
               MOVE EXP-DATA-COMMENT   TO  HOLD-TEXT
           ELSE
           IF EXP-PRT-START = "*CMP*"
               MOVE COMP-DATA-COMMENT  TO  HOLD-TEXT
           ELSE
               MOVE DCOM-DATA-LINE     TO  HOLD-TEXT.

       925-CHECK-TEXT.
           SET BAD-CHAR TO TRUE.
           IF FULL-TEXT (SUB:1) = " "
               SET GOOD-CHAR TO TRUE
           ELSE IF FULL-TEXT (SUB:1) >= "0"
                AND FULL-TEXT (SUB:1) <= "9"
               SET GOOD-CHAR TO TRUE
           ELSE IF FULL-TEXT (SUB:1) >= "S"
                AND FULL-TEXT (SUB:1) <= "Z"
               SET GOOD-CHAR TO TRUE
           ELSE IF FULL-TEXT (SUB:1) >= "J"
                AND FULL-TEXT (SUB:1) <= "R"
               SET GOOD-CHAR TO TRUE
           ELSE IF FULL-TEXT (SUB:1) >= "A"
                AND FULL-TEXT (SUB:1) <= "I"
               SET GOOD-CHAR TO TRUE
           ELSE IF FULL-TEXT (SUB:1) >= "s"
                AND FULL-TEXT (SUB:1) <= "z"
               SET GOOD-CHAR TO TRUE
           ELSE IF FULL-TEXT (SUB:1) >= "j"
                AND FULL-TEXT (SUB:1) <= "r"
               SET GOOD-CHAR TO TRUE
           ELSE IF FULL-TEXT (SUB:1) >= "a"
                AND FULL-TEXT (SUB:1) <= "i"
               SET GOOD-CHAR TO TRUE
           ELSE IF FULL-TEXT (SUB:1) >= ":"
                AND FULL-TEXT (SUB:1) <= "="
      * Need to modify prev line to look for " instead of =
               SET GOOD-CHAR TO TRUE
           ELSE IF FULL-TEXT (SUB:1) >= QUOTES
               SET GOOD-CHAR TO TRUE
           ELSE IF FULL-TEXT (SUB:1) >= ","
                AND FULL-TEXT (SUB:1) <= "?"
               SET GOOD-CHAR TO TRUE
           ELSE IF FULL-TEXT (SUB:1) >= "!"
                AND FULL-TEXT (SUB:1) <= "/"
               SET GOOD-CHAR TO TRUE
           ELSE IF FULL-TEXT (SUB:1) >= "."
                AND FULL-TEXT (SUB:1) <= "&"
               SET GOOD-CHAR TO TRUE
           END-IF.
           IF BAD-CHAR
               MOVE "*" TO FULL-TEXT (SUB:1)
           END-IF.

       930-COMPUTE-DLV-VAL.
           MOVE PO-RCV-NO           TO  PO-ARG.
           MOVE 0                   TO  HOLD-DLV-VAL
                                        HOLD-DLV-TOT-VAL.
           PERFORM 9999-START-DPOITEM-I.
           PERFORM 9999-GETNEXT-DPOITEM-I.
           PERFORM UNTIL FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                      OR ITM-PO-RCV-NO > PO-ARG
               COMPUTE HOLD-DLV-VAL = ITM-QTY-DLVR * ITM-UNIT-PRICE
               ADD HOLD-DLV-VAL     TO HOLD-DLV-TOT-VAL
               PERFORM 9999-GETNEXT-DPOITEM-I
           END-PERFORM.

       931-COMPUTE-INV-VAL.
           MOVE PO-RCV-NO           TO  PO-ARG.
           MOVE 0                   TO  HOLD-INV-TOT-VAL.
           PERFORM 9999-START-DINVRCD-I.
           PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DINVRCD-I.
           PERFORM UNTIL FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                      OR PORCVNO OF DINVRCD-REC-I NOT = PO-ARG
               IF INV-STATUS = "I" OR "H"
                   CONTINUE
      *            NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
                   ADD INV-NET-DUE-VENDOR  TO
                       HOLD-INV-TOT-VAL
               END-IF
               PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DINVRCD-I
           END-PERFORM.

       932-COMPUTE-INV-ITM-VAL.
           MOVE PO-RCV-NO           TO  PO-ARG.
           MOVE 0                   TO  HOLD-INV-ITM-TOT.
           PERFORM 9999-START-DINVRCD-I.
           PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DINVRCD-I.
           PERFORM UNTIL FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                      OR PORCVNO OF DINVRCD-REC-I NOT = PO-ARG
               IF INV-STATUS = "I" OR "H"
                   CONTINUE
      *             NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
                   PERFORM 940-FIND-INV-ITEMS
               END-IF
               PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DINVRCD-I
           END-PERFORM.

       940-FIND-INV-ITEMS.
           MOVE INV-REG-NO TO REG-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-START-DINVITM-I.
           PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DINVITM-I.
           PERFORM UNTIL REGISTERNO OF DINVITM-REC-I NOT = REG-ARG
                                    OR   FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF INVITM-ITEM-NO = ITM-NUMBER
                   IF INV-PAYMENT-IND = "I"
                       IF INVITM-INV-QTY-PD = ZEROES
                           ADD INVITM-INV-UPRICE TO HOLD-INV-ITM-TOT
                       ELSE
                           COMPUTE HOLD-INV-ITM-TOT = HOLD-INV-ITM-TOT
                                                    + (INVITM-INV-UPRICE
                                                    * INVITM-INV-QTY-PD)
                       END-IF
                   ELSE
                       IF INVITM-PO-QTY-PD = ZEROES
                           ADD INVITM-PO-UPRICE TO HOLD-INV-ITM-TOT
                       ELSE
                           COMPUTE HOLD-INV-ITM-TOT = HOLD-INV-ITM-TOT
                                                    + (INVITM-PO-UPRICE
                                                    * INVITM-PO-QTY-PD)
                       END-IF
                   END-IF
               END-IF
               PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DINVITM-I
           END-PERFORM.

       941-FIND-CURRENCY.
           MOVE SPACES                         TO  H1-CURRENCY.
           IF PO-CURRENCY-CODE > SPACES
               EVALUATE PO-CURRENCY-CODE
                   WHEN "01"    MOVE "USD  "   TO  H1-CURRENCY
                   WHEN "08"    MOVE "CAD  "   TO  H1-CURRENCY
               END-EVALUATE
           ELSE
               EVALUATE HOLD-HOME-CUR
                   WHEN "01"    MOVE "USD  "   TO  H1-CURRENCY
                   WHEN "08"    MOVE "CAD  "   TO  H1-CURRENCY
               END-EVALUATE.
           IF H1-CURRENCY = SPACES
               MOVE "*****"                    TO  H1-CURRENCY.

       980-PRINT-DATA.
           IF LINE-NUM > MAX-LINES
               PERFORM 981-NEW-PAGE.
           WRITE PRINT-REC FROM PRINT-LINE
               AFTER ADVANCING 2.
           ADD 2 TO LINE-NUM.

       981-NEW-PAGE.
           ADD 1 TO PAGE-NUM.
           MOVE PAGE-NUM TO HDR-PAGE.
           IF PAGE-NUM > 1
               WRITE PRINT-REC FROM HEADER-REC-1
                     AFTER PAGE-EJECT
           ELSE
               WRITE PRINT-REC FROM HEADER-REC-1.
           WRITE PRINT-REC FROM HEADER-REC-2.
           WRITE PRINT-REC FROM HEADER-REC-3.
           MOVE 3 TO LINE-NUM.

       990-DO-NOTHING.

      *---------- SEE IF STANDARD INSTRUCTION SHOULD BE EXCLUDED.
       991-SEARCH-INSTR-TABLE.
           MOVE "N"                        TO  EXCLUDE-INSTR-SW.
           SET J TO 1.
           SEARCH INSTR-ENTRY
               AT END
                   MOVE "N"                TO  EXCLUDE-INSTR-SW
               WHEN INSTR-ENTRY (J) = STD-INST-NO (SUB)
                   MOVE "Y"                TO  EXCLUDE-INSTR-SW.

      /**************************************************************
      ** U T I L I T Y   P A R A G R A P H S                       **
      ***************************************************************

      ***************************************************************
      ** D P O R E C D                                             **
      ***************************************************************

       9999-START-DPORECD-I.
           MOVE LOW-VALUES TO BUYERCDE OF DPORECD-REC-I.
           START DPORECD-I KEY > BUYERCDE OF DPORECD-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.

       9999-GETNEXT-DPORECD-I.
           READ DPORECD-I NEXT INTO BUF-DPORECD
               AT END MOVE "Y" TO DPORECD-EOF-SW.

      ***************************************************************
      ** D P O I T E M                                             **
      ***************************************************************

       9999-START-DPOITEM-I.
           MOVE PO-ARG TO PORCVNO OF DPOITEM-REC-I.
           START DPOITEM-I KEY >= PORCVNO OF DPOITEM-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.

       9999-GETNEXT-DPOITEM-I.
           READ DPOITEM-I NEXT INTO BUF-DPOITEM
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.

      ***************************************************************
      ** D P O D A T A I T M                                       **
      ***************************************************************

       9999-GET-DPODATAITM.
           MOVE SPACES  TO  STD-INST-SAVED.
           MOVE PO-ARG  TO PORCVNO OF DPODATAITM-REC-I.
           MOVE "000001" TO ITEMSEQNO OF DPODATAITM-REC-I.
           READ DPODATAITM-I INTO BUF-DPODATAITM
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE SPACES        TO STD-INST-SAVED
           ELSE
               MOVE DATAITM-INFO  TO STD-INST-SAVED.

       9999-GET-FIRST-DPODATAITM.
           MOVE PO-ARG  TO PORCVNO OF DPODATAITM-REC-I.
           READ DPODATAITM-I INTO BUF-DPODATAITM
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.

       9999-START-DPODATAITM.
           MOVE PO-ARG  TO PORCVNO OF DPODATAITM-REC-I.
           START DPODATAITM-I KEY = PORCVNO OF DPODATAITM-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.

       9999-READ-NEXT-DPODATAITM.
           READ DPODATAITM-I NEXT INTO BUF-DPODATAITM
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.

      ***************************************************************
      ** D C O M M E N T                                           **
      ***************************************************************

       9999-START-DCOMMENT.
           START DCOMMENT-I KEY = MCOMCOMMNT OF DCOMMENT-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.

       9999-READ-NEXT-DCOMMENT.
           READ DCOMMENT-I NEXT INTO BUF-DCOMMENT
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.

      ***************************************************************
      ** D I N V R C D                                             **
      ***************************************************************

       9999-START-DINVRCD-I.
           MOVE PO-ARG TO PORCVNO OF DINVRCD-REC-I.
           START DINVRCD-I KEY = PORCVNO OF DINVRCD-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.

       9999-READ-NEXT-DINVRCD-I.
           READ DINVRCD-I NEXT INTO BUF-DINVRCD
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.

      ***************************************************************
      ** D I N V I T M                                             **
      ***************************************************************

       9999-START-DINVITM-I.
           MOVE REG-ARG TO REGISTERNO OF DINVITM-REC-I.
           START DINVITM-I KEY = REGISTERNO OF DINVITM-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.

       9999-READ-NEXT-DINVITM-I.
           READ DINVITM-I NEXT INTO BUF-DINVITM
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.

      ***************************************************************
      ** M S T O R E R M                                           **
      ***************************************************************

       9999-READ-MSTORERM-I.
           SET NON-CONSIGNMENT TO TRUE.
           MOVE CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC-I.
           READ MSTORERM-I INTO BUF-MSTORERM
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF STR-CONS-IND NOT = SPACES
               SET ON-CONSIGNMENT TO TRUE.

